Description: Computes and visualizes quantitative predictions from the logical
    model of minority representation developed by Atsusaka (2021)
    <doi:10.1017/S000305542100054X>. Functions support district-level prediction,
    jurisdiction-level simulation, and redistricting scenario analysis. The
    package includes the Louisiana mayoral and state legislative election data
    used to evaluate the model <doi:10.7910/DVN/F2OX6O>.
